/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:646:On multi-hop RAG tasks from HotpotQA, increasing OpenViking retrieval from top-5 to top-20 delivers the highest accuracy in this comparison while keeping retrieval latency low:
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:648:| Method | Retrieval Pattern | Accuracy | Tokens / QA | Latency / QA |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:650:| Naive RAG | Vector retrieval | 62.50% | 1,290 | **0.11s** |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:654:| OpenViking (top-5) | Vector retrieval | 72.75% | 3,154 | 0.22s |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:655:| OpenViking (top-20) | Vector retrieval | **91.00%** | 12,533 | 0.23s |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:656:| Nanobot + OpenViking (Agent) | Vector retrieval + Agent | 87.00% | 71,300 | 61.6s |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:660:| Method | Retrieval Pattern | Average Accuracy | Indexing Tokens | Tokens / QA | Retrieval Latency |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:662:| Naive RAG | Vector retrieval | 53.93% | 2,755,356 | 1,435 | **0.13s** |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:666:| **OpenViking** | **Vector retrieval** | **66.87%** | **8,671,538** | **3,060** | **0.19s** |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:668:> Datasets: FinanceBench, NaturalQuestions, ClapNQ, Qasper, and SyllabusQA. OpenViking reaches 66.87% average accuracy with very low retrieval latency (0.19s), while indexing cost is only 13.8% of LightRAG.
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:720:- **L0 (Abstract)**: A one-sentence summary for quick retrieval and identification.
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:743:### 3. Directory Recursive Retrieval → Improves Retrieval Effect
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:745:Single vector retrieval struggles with complex query intents. OpenViking has designed an innovative **Directory Recursive Retrieval Strategy** that deeply integrates multiple retrieval methods:
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:747:1. **Intent Analysis**: Generate multiple retrieval conditions through intent analysis.
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:748:2. **Initial Positioning**: Use vector retrieval to quickly locate the high-score directory where the initial slice is located.
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:749:3. **Refined Exploration**: Perform a secondary retrieval within that directory and update high-score results to the candidate set.
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:750:4. **Recursive Drill-down**: If subdirectories exist, recursively repeat the secondary retrieval steps layer by layer.
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:753:This "lock high-score directory first, then refine content exploration" strategy not only finds the semantically best-matching fragments but also understands the full context where the information resides, thereby improving the globality and accuracy of retrieval. Learn more: [Retrieval Mechanism](./docs/en/concepts/07-retrieval.md)
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:755:### 4. Visualized Retrieval Trajectory → Observable Context
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:759:The retrieval process adopts a directory recursive strategy. The trajectory of directory browsing and file positioning for each retrieval is fully preserved, allowing users to clearly observe the root cause of problems and guide the optimization of retrieval logic. Learn more: [Retrieval Mechanism](./docs/en/concepts/07-retrieval.md)
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:766:- **Agent Experience Accumulation**: Extract core content such as operational tips and tool usage experience from task execution experience, aiding efficient decision-making in subsequent tasks.
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/README.md:791:  - 🎮 **Discord**: [Join Discord Server](https://discord.com/invite/eHvx8E9XF3)
