/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/docs/design/metric-design.md:21:| `BaseObserver` | `openviking/storage/observers/base_observer.py` | `get_status_table/is_healthy/has_errors` | 瞬时状态语义清晰 |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/docs/design/metric-design.md:22:| `PrometheusObserver` | `openviking/storage/observers/prometheus_observer.py` | 进程内存储 Counter/Histogram + 渲染 `/metrics` | 与 Observer 体系职责不一致，属于“异类” |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/docs/design/metric-design.md:23:| 业务埋点（retrieval/embedding/vlm 等） | 多处 | 直接回调 observer 写指标 | 采集层与导出层强耦合，难扩展/难测试 |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/docs/design/metric-design.md:24:| `/metrics` 路由 | `openviking/server/routers/metrics.py` | 直接取 `app.state.prometheus_observer` | 路由层绑定具体实现对象，而非 exporter 抽象 |
/var/folders/xc/0r_c47w14qqf24dq6f0tgfq40000gn/T/tmp.ZBj6ZdBEgX/OpenViking/docs/design/metric-design.md:26:当前 `/metrics` 已打通的指标主要集中在 retrieval/embedding/vlm/cache 的少量 counter/histogram 指标族，覆盖面偏窄。
